  <graph edgedefault="undirected">
    <node id="&quot;VIRGINIA COMMONWEALTH UNIVERSITY (VCU)&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Virginia Commonwealth University (VCU) is a beacon of intellectual curiosity and innovation, located in Richmond, Virginia, and has been a significant part of Janice Kuhn's career."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0341</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;JANICE KUHN&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Janice Kuhn is a researcher whose contributions to her field have left an indelible mark, affiliated with the Department of Biology at VCU and involved in various research endeavors and university committees."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0341</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;RICHMOND, VIRGINIA&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Richmond, Virginia is the city where Virginia Commonwealth University (VCU) is located, and it is the setting of Janice Kuhn's academic journey."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0341</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;NATIONAL SCIENCE FOUNDATION&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The National Science Foundation has awarded research grants to Janice Kuhn, recognizing her expertise and contributions to her field."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0341</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;AMERICAN HEART ASSOCIATION&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The American Heart Association has also awarded research grants to Janice Kuhn, further highlighting her standing within the academic community."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0341</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;JOURNAL OF EXPERIMENTAL BIOLOGY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Journal of Experimental Biology is where one of Janice Kuhn's notable research papers was published, presenting a seminal exploration of protein function and its implications for human disease."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0341</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;DEPARTMENT OF BIOLOGY AT VCU&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Department of Biology at VCU is where Janice Kuhn was affiliated and conducted much of her research."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0341</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;JOURNAL OF BIOLOGICAL CHEMISTRY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Journal of Biological Chemistry is another esteemed scientific journal where Janice Kuhn has published papers, showcasing her prolificacy."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0341</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;AMERICAN JOURNAL OF PHYSIOLOGY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The American Journal of Physiology is yet another scientific journal where Janice Kuhn has published papers, further demonstrating her contributions to her field."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0341</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;UNIVERSITY'S RESEARCH COUNCIL&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The University's Research Council is a body at VCU that Janice Kuhn has participated in, shaping institutional research policy."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0341</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;YALE UNIVERSITY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Yale University is committed to addressing global challenges through interdisciplinary research and collaboration."&lt;SEP&gt;"Yale University is where Dr. Janice Kuhn currently works and made a significant discovery in environmental science."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0341</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;NEW HAVEN, CT&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"New Haven, CT is the city where Yale University is located, and it is the setting of Dr. Janice Kuhn's recent research."</data>
